# A padded irregular cell grid grows separate rock groups through the
# source's weighted seed and adjacency rules. Terrain is drawn in Lua.
NAME:   layout_cellular_growth
DEPTH:  Lair, Zot, Pan
WEIGHT: 2 (Lair), 5 (Zot), 10 (Pan)
ORIENT: encompass
TAGS:   overwritable layout allow_dup unrand layout_type_passages
: vault.run("layout_cellular_growth")
MAP
ENDMAP
